 "stimulus_html": "<p>For questions 6 – 7, use this situation and function:</p>\n<blockquote>\nThe daily cost to the manufacturing company is modeled by the function <span data-math=\"C(x)=7.25x+2500\">C(x)=7.25x+2500</span>, where <span data-math=\"C(x)\">C(x)</span> is the total daily cost and <span data-math=\"x\">x</span> is the number of items manufactured.</blockquote>\n <br>",
